# Gen 2 is all three games

This editor supports **Gold, Silver, and Crystal**. Do not write Gold-only comments, status text, tooltips, or assumptions for shared Gen 2 behavior.

- Gate shared Gen 2 features with `Generation.isGen2(S)` (covers `gold`, `silver`, `crystal`).
- Use `Generation.isCrystal(S)` / `Generation.engine(S)` only when Crystal or GS actually differ.
- Item balls, scripts, maps, palettes, and pickup use the same Gen 2 data unless a game-specific check already exists.
- New mods target `Generation.manifestGames` (`all`), not `games: ["gold"]`.

```lua
-- BAD
-- Gold pickup uses obj.itemball
if S.version == "gold" then ...

-- GOOD
-- Gen 2 pickup uses obj.itemball
if Generation.isGen2(S) then ...
```
